# MakeHuman2 Material definition for nightie
name nightie
description Nightie material

ambientColor 1.0 1.0 1.0
diffuseColor 0.5 0.5 0.5
specularColor 0.5 0.5 0.5
emissiveColor 0.0 0.0 0.0
metallicFactor 0.0
